OL,4,CEx-Kenyan governor jailed for 25 years 
OL,5,Cover pregnant girlfriend's murder      
OL,6,GA former Kenyan governor has been      
OL,7,Gjailed for 25 years for the murder of  
OL,8,Ga university student who was seven     
OL,9,Gmonths pregnant with his child.        
OL,11,FThe High Court on Friday sentenced     
OL,12,FZacharia Okoth Obado, the former       
OL,13,Fgovernor of Migori County, along with  
OL,14,Ftwo former aides, over the 2018        
OL,15,Fkilling of Sharon Belyne Otieno.       
OL,17,FThe investigation established that an  
OL,18,F"intimate relationship" had existed    
OL,19,Fbetween Obado and Otieno, which        
OL,20,F"subsequently led to a pregnancy with  
OL,21,Fthe deceased that the governor was     
OL,22,Funhappy about".                        
